    "note": "Our own grammar for the well-known Avro phonetic conventions. It is NOT copied from any existing implementation: the reference implementations are GPL-3.0 (avro-php), MPL (ibus-avro) or unstated (jsAvroPhonetic), and none of them can be relicensed under this project's MIT licence. See docs/DECISIONS.md for the licence analysis. Every row records where it came from; the rows whose source is `reference` follow the behaviour those implementations publish (their documented key table and their own published test vectors), used as a specification with no code taken. Rows stay nativeReviewed:false until the owner checks them; see docs/VERIFY.md.",
    "sources": {
      "masterplan": "docs/MASTERPLAN.md Section 7.6 starter test cases (authoritative for this project)",
      "guide": "published third-party Avro Phonetic guide (learntype.app, Avro Phonetic Bangla Typing: Complete Guide)",
      "reference": "the published key table and behaviour of the Avro Phonetic reference implementations, taken as a specification (their documentation and published test vectors); no code was copied",
      "curated": "a curated exception list in this file's dictionary section, for whole words a rule engine cannot spell; each entry needs a native speaker's confirmation (docs/VERIFY.md item 28)",
      "unsourced": "not attested by a written source; needs a native speaker before this mode can be trusted"
    }
  },

